`probe_move_into_v0.py:143-150` shells `tasklist /FI "IMAGENAME eq LabVIEW.exe" /FO CSV /NH`, which returns image name, PID and memory — **never a handle count**. `:88` (P5) nevertheless promises *"LabVIEW **handle count** is recorded before and after."* Run 1 shows what was actually recorded: `tools/bench/probe_move_into_v0.log:3` — the tasklist "no matching task" error string.

